<programme channel="Cinemax.Hits.us2" start="20260930111000 +0000" stop="20260930123000 +0000">
    <title lang="en">For All Mankind</title>
    <desc lang="en">Directed by Al Reinert and with music scored by Brian Eno, "For All Mankind" provides a testament to NASA's Apollo program of the 1960s and '70s. Composed of actual NASA footage of the missions and astronaut interviews, the documentary offers the viewpoint of the individuals who braved the remarkable journey to the moon and back. While compiling the material for the film, Reinert went through more than six million feet of film of these historic moments.</desc>
    <credits>
